        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Crawl space mold removal comes down to an order of operations. Fix the water, protect yourself, remove what you can with a HEPA vacuum and a brush, kill what remains with a registered fungicide like <strong class="text-white">RMR-141</strong>, and then keep the space dry enough that mold has nothing to work with.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Small, accessible jobs are well within a homeowner's reach. Large areas, wet insulation, standing water or health concerns are the point to get quotes, and any quote that does not address the moisture is not worth taking.
          </p>
